on e-parent\" data-id=\"1f74114\" data-element_type=\"container\" id=\"greeting-section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51fc928 e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"51fc928\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1429254 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1429254\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Greetings!<\/b> My name is Nicole, but <span class=\"greet-name-underline\"><b>Nicky<\/b><\/span> works just fine! I\u2019m here to help anyone with anything writing-related. And whether you pronounce it Klah-vee-oh or Klay-vee-oh, I promise <b>your emails will sound a lot better<\/b> once I\u2019ve had a go at them.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e83701 e-con-full e-grid elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5e83701\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfe597c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bfe597c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d8083b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d8083b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You\u2019ve got a business, project, or idea, but the words you need escape you? Well, I can\u2019t relate to that. What I can do is capture those elusive words and shape them into compelling copy that <b>brings your vision to life<\/b>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b02e3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6b02e3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAs the self-crowned Empress of Eloquence, I\u2019ve spent the last <b>6 years<\/b> creating <b>email strategy<\/b> and <b>writing copy<\/b> for everything from supplements to cryptocurrencies, pre-loved diamonds to flavoured bottles. I\u2019ve written essays about sexuality in Russian literature and created multi-lingual cyphers for fantasy brands. Scroll to my clients\u2019 reviews and you\u2019ll see why <b>I\u2019m the best in the business<\/b>.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a96835 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2a96835\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"492\" height=\"507\" src=\"https:\/\/pezzamedia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Bio-picture-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-203\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/pezzamedia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Bio-picture-1.png 492w, https:\/\/pezzamedia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Bio-picture-1-291x300.png 291w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e588d1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8e588d1\" data-element_type=\"container\" id=\"copyright-section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7925ae0 e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7925ae0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7820d86 e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7820d86\" data-element_type=\"